Emerging Market Opportunities
The development of AI-focused data centers creates opportunities for high-capacity optical transport hardware and coherent pluggable optics. Suppliers can also address demand for resilient metro and long-haul connections as cloud operators distribute computing resources across multiple locations.

Network automation, advanced traffic management, and integrated monitoring software provide additional opportunities to improve network utilization and simplify operations.

Regional Market Insights
