Europe: Demand is supported by data center expansion, enterprise connectivity requirements, and investment in regional fiber networks.
Asia-Pacific: Cloud infrastructure investment and expanding digital services are driving demand in China, India, and Japan.
South America: Brazil represents an important market, with demand linked to colocation expansion and metropolitan fiber connectivity.
Middle East & Africa: Infrastructure investment and new data center clusters are creating opportunities for high-capacity interconnection solutions.

